      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of dehumanization and burnout from your daily routine. Feeling like just a cog in a machine can be incredibly isolating and draining. Please know that your worth is far greater than your productivity or your job tasks. Taking small moments to reconnect with things that bring you joy outside of work could be a vital first step toward reclaiming your sense of self.",
